Third-party components carried by this distribution retain their own
licenses and copyright notices, kept alongside each component:

  - reference/pinned/ and the data derived from it: LuaTeX-ja
    (BSD-3-Clause), ltjclasses/ltjsclasses (ASCII / Japanese TeX
    Development Community + LuaTeX-ja), jsclasses (BSD-2-Clause),
    used as porting references and derivative-data sources.
  - data/jfm-standard-*.lua: derived from the BSD-licensed JFM metrics
    recorded in the LuaTeX-ja project.
  - Fonts generated at build time from TeX Live's IPAex / IPA /
    HaranoAji carry those fonts' licenses texts; the generator copies
    the notice files into the build output.
